1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,115
Lesson two.

2
00:00:01,115 --> 00:00:05,526
A prompt is simply the instruction you give to an AI.

3
00:00:05,526 --> 00:00:08,689
A better prompt gives a better answer.

4
00:00:08,689 --> 00:00:12,600
Here is a simple formula you can use every day.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,416
Look at this prompt: write about marketing.

6
00:00:16,416 --> 00:00:17,687
It is too vague.

7
00:00:17,687 --> 00:00:24,200
The AI has to guess everything, so the answer will be generic and not very useful.

8
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:25,822
Use five parts.

9
00:00:25,822 --> 00:00:28,754
One, the role: who should the AI be.

10
00:00:28,754 --> 00:00:32,093
Two, the task: what exactly should it do.

11
00:00:32,093 --> 00:00:35,514
Three, the context: who is the answer for.

12
00:00:35,514 --> 00:00:39,261
Four, the format: a list, a table or an email.

13
00:00:39,261 --> 00:00:42,600
Five, the limits: length, tone and level.

14
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,166
A good prompt looks like this.

15
00:00:45,166 --> 00:00:47,043
Act as a friendly teacher.

16
00:00:47,043 --> 00:00:52,169
Explain what an online portfolio is, for a beginner with no experience.

17
00:00:52,169 --> 00:00:57,800
Use five bullet points, in simple English, under one hundred and twenty words.

18
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:00,707
Do not stop at the first answer.

19
00:01:00,707 --> 00:01:03,920
Read it, then say exactly what to change.

20
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:08,856
Ask for another version, or ask the AI what it is unsure about.

21
00:01:08,856 --> 00:01:13,400
A conversation gets better results than a single question.

22
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:15,444
Examples help a lot.

23
00:01:15,444 --> 00:01:23,005
Paste a short sample of the style you like, show the result you want, and say what to avoid.

24
00:01:23,005 --> 00:01:25,800
The AI follows examples very well.

25
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:29,828
Remember: a clear prompt gives a useful answer.

26
00:01:29,828 --> 00:01:34,151
Practice the five-part formula today with one real task.

27
00:01:34,151 --> 00:01:39,400
In the next lesson we will learn how to check what the AI tells you.

